      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The simple solid-solution state of equimolar CoCrFeNiTi lacks a sufficient degree of short-range atomic ordering, particularly Ti-associated ordering.",
